<section id="salary-trends">
    <h2>Salary Trends &amp; Segmentation</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Compensation dynamics reveal both the premium commanded by resilient roles and the structural shifts unfolding across geographies and career stages. This section examines salary evolution and its explicit relationship with automation risk.</p>

    <h3>Global Salary Evolution</h3>
